04bdd4%2Fhowabearbecameabook-9781250358448-int-36-37.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3148x1771+3578+1758/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F6a%2F24597b5040b8b3e7ae79c104bdd4%2Fhowabearbecameabook-9781250358448-int-36-37.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3148x1771+3578+1758/resize/1800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F6a%2F24597b5040b8b3e7ae79c104bdd4%2Fhowabearbecameabook-9781250358448-int-36-37.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3148x1771+3578+1758/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F6a%2F24597b5040b8b3e7ae79c104bdd4%2Fhowabearbecameabook-9781250358448-int-36-37.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3148x1771+3578+1758/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F6a%2F24597b5040b8b3e7ae79c104bdd4%2Fhowabearbecameabook-9781250358448-int-36-37.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3148x1771+3578+1758/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe5%2F6a%2F24597b5040b8b3e7ae79c104bdd4%2Fhowabearbecameabook-9781250358448-int-36-37.jpg" class="img" alt="How a Bear Became a Book, written by Annette Bay Pimentel and illustrated by Faith Pray" loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 &lt;em&gt;How a Bear Became a Book&lt;/em&gt;, written by Annette Bay Pimentel and illustrated by Faith Pray                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;b class="toggle-caption"&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/b&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;One hundred years after the first collection of Winnie-the-Pooh stories was published, a new children's book celebrates the beloved works and the celebration that brought them to life. &lt;em&gt;How a Bear Became a Book: The Collaboration That Created Winnie-the-Pooh &lt;/em&gt;explores the relationship between author A.A. Milne and illustrator Ernest H. Shepard. The new book, written by Annette Bay Pimentel and illustrated by Faith Pray, pays homage to the originals by echoing Winnie's original voice and Shepard's artistic style. Check out &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/08/22/nx-s1-5697049/how-a-bear-became-a-book-annette-bay-pimentel-faith-pray" target="_blank"&gt;some pages of the new book&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;3 things to know before you go&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-139726" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 4032;         --source-height: 2268;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4032x2268+0+297/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3c%2F7c%2Ff1eb163047479c477379e538b3ca%2Fap26235796925254.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4032x2268+0+297/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F3c%2F7c%2Ff1eb163047479c477379e538b3ca%2Fap26235796925254.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4032x2268+0+297/re